<title>USA: U.S. rice stocks on August 1 -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. rice stocks on August 1 -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported U.S. rice stocks in all states on August 1 (1,000 hundred lbs):</p>
<p>			   ----ROUGH RICE----    ---MILLED RICE---</p>
<p>			   08/01/96  08/01/95    08/01/96  08/01/95</p>
<p>	     On Farm-X	486	 862	   N/A	 N/A</p>
<p>	    In Mills-X    5,542     6 578	 3,296     4,225</p>
<p>     In Warehouses-Z   13,818    15,279	   269     1,028</p>
<p> In Ports/In Transit	125	  45	    49     1,055</p>
<p> Total All Positions   19,971    22,764	 3,614     6,308</p>
<p>X-Includes stocks in farm warehouses. Y-Includes stocks in attached warehouses. Z-Warehouses not attached to mills.  </p>
<p>U.S. March 1 rice stocks in all states (1,000 hundredweight):</p>
<p>			   ----ROUGH RICE----    ---MILLED RICE---</p>
<p>			   03/01/96  03/01/95    03/01/96  03/01/95</p>
<p>	     On Farm-X   20,520    23,239	   N/A	 N/A</p>
<p>	    In Mills-X   11,102    12 793	 3,072     4,078</p>
<p>     In Warehouses-Z   53,283    59,271	   148	 349</p>
<p> In Ports/In Transit	941	 622	   479     1,192</p>
<p> Total All Positions   85,846    95,925	 3,699     5,619</p>
<p>X-Includes stocks in farm warehouses. Y-Includes stocks in attached warehouses. Z-Warehouses not attached to mills.</p>
